  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Electoral Cycle for Transparent and Peaceful Elections in Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action seeks to contribute to capacity building and conflict prevention to key electoral reform stakeholders with a comprehensive approach. The overall objective of the Action is the promotion of peaceful, inclusive, transparent and credible elections in Honduras, through an electoral cycle approach. This may be achieved on one hand through support to electoral management and on the other hand through supporting conflict prevention and fostering a culture of peace, which includes the implementation of measures that contribute to overcoming the barriers of gender discrimination in the political arena</narrative>
  </description>
